WEBVTT

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:26.660
the speed of night just realized my birthday's this tuesday it's only three days away is away now

00:01:27.130 --> 00:01:29.350
wow i can hardly wait

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:31.520
Let's head for Sky City.

00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:33.560
They really know how to throw a party.

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:36.340
Music, food, and tons of presents.

00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:38.460
Presents?

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.970
Oh, when am I gonna get Sonic?

00:01:43.550 --> 00:01:44.750
Let's speed, kid.

00:01:45.490 --> 00:01:45.810
Whoa!

00:01:58.740 --> 00:01:59.940
It's almost Sonic's birthday.

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:02.440
And I don't have a present for him yet.

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:07.060
Sonic's my best buddy too. He deserves something great.

00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:10.090
Somehow I gotta get some money.

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:17.300
If I get this yard clean, Mr. Bradley will pay me ten mobiums.

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:21.080
I can buy Sonic a real great present with that.

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:25.480
This is hot work!

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:28.040
But I know how to make it a breeze.

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:31.280
Thank you.

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:34.550
Nothing to it.

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:37.390
Huh?

00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:41.050
all morning raking them leaves off my lawn.

00:02:41.190 --> 00:02:41.550
Get him!

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:43.980
Yes, sir.

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:46.360
Now I have two ones to do.

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:47.460
Oh, well.

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:49.840
I guess I'm just going to have to blow them harder.

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:51.240
Faster!

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:53.020
I gotta go faster!

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:07.990
What? Uh-oh. Tornado!

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:13.410
Gotta create a counterforce.

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:26.840
Sonic missed. I was just trying to make some money.

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:28.920
Money? What for?

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:29.980
Something...

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:38.540
I can't tell you look I can loan you some money. No, that wouldn't be right. You gotta let me do this, Sonic

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:46.120
Okay, but be careful. You hear me a paper route. No, I didn't think of this before

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:51.400
They should be no trouble just to the end of the street and I whoa

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:59.710
It's gonna take forever. It's not fair. Sonic would do this in a second

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:03.090
Hey, that gives me an idea.

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:10.060
It's hard to aim at the speed.

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:27.190
Look at the speed and to good use.

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:35.830
Uh-oh! Not again!

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:46.620
Gotta blow! What on Mobius was all that about, Tails?

00:04:47.170 --> 00:04:51.410
I'm sorry, Sonic. It won't happen again. I promise!

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:55.380
Are you trying to make some money to do something for me?

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:56.880
Uh...

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:59.960
Look, doing something for a pal to...

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.140
He doesn't need money. What I really want is to have you safe.

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:11.130
Sonic's right. But how am I going to get a present for free?

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:15.450
City dump, huh?

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:25.120
Maybe. That's a good start, but what else?

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:55.110
I connected that to there, right, and I did that.

00:05:55.350 --> 00:05:57.920
Darn! Still doesn't look right!

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:01.870
I hope Sonic likes it.

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:08.200
Wow, Tails, you shouldn't have.

00:06:08.490 --> 00:06:09.270
What is it?

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:10.470
Wait and see.

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:12.960
Wait? Oh, I hate that.

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:15.600
Look, Grounder, Sonic's having a party,

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:16.960
and he forgot to invite us.

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:21.090
Oh, well, I guess we'll just have to crush it.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:21.550
Yeah?

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:24.510
We'll give him the gift that keeps on giving.

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:27.970
An all-expense-paid trip to Robotnik's Dungeons!

00:06:49.230 --> 00:06:59.980
false teeth for this party. Sonic Chopper, don't be so quick to snap at Sonic the head.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:00.500
Hedgehog.

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:01.870
Oh, got it.

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:24.930
Three.

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:36.070
I think I'm going to be sick to my stomach.

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:39.190
No, we don't have stomachs, you dimbot!

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:42.100
Then I'm going to be sick to my transmission.

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:44.720
That was great, Sonic!

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:46.460
Yeah, it was.

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:49.520
Hey, and great heroes deserve a reward.

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:51.010
I want to open my present.

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:53.840
Wow!

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:56.560
Where did you find this awesome thing?

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:57.680
I made it!

00:07:58.170 --> 00:07:59.050
You made it?

00:07:59.210 --> 00:07:59.970
How does it...

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:02.900
I don't know. Give it a try.

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:04.690
Yahoo!

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:08.420
Sonic, look out for the...

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:09.440
Yahoo!

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:14.440
No, he's a goner.

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:19.300
Great, it's a hover hand glider.

00:08:19.510 --> 00:08:20.910
Let's go, little bro.

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:26.370
Hey, everyone, look at my awesome birthday present

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:28.990
made by my own genius buddy, Tails.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:34.010
You're a genius at making stuff!

00:08:37.890 --> 00:08:39.630
Got to tell Dr. Robotnik!

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:42.910
Why? Fall out of trees all the time!

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:46.280
No you don't, Brain! About hell!

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:54.820
If it isn't the Bungling Brothers burnout and bailing circus!

00:08:55.440 --> 00:08:59.140
Oh boy! The circus! Wow! Where? Where?

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:03.570
Well, what have you got to report?

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:08.040
That fox, Tails, just built Sonic a functional flying machine.

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:10.360
Yeah, it even worked, too.

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:15.200
Really? That's a lot more than I can say for you two.

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:26.700
So, Sonic's little friend has a talent for machinery, hmm?

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:29.360
Perhaps he could be useful.

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:33.220
But you're going to get Tails to help you.

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:37.440
Yeah, Tails may be a genius, but he's not stupid.

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:39.420
I'll find a way.

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:42.940
I'll make him cooperate of his own free will,

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:45.800
even if I have to force him.

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:54.760
Tails gave me a great birthday gift,

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:58.520
but it would also be great to have Robotnik on a silver platter.

00:09:58.950 --> 00:09:59.270
Ah!

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.380
So that's why you want us to build this thing.

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:07.060
The Robotnik Nabber will smash through that nasty forepress

00:10:07.060 --> 00:10:08.480
and scoop him right up,

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:11.960
ending his reign of terror once and for sometimes.

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:15.320
And with my genius buddy Tails helping to build it,

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:17.320
there's no way it can fail.

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:23.320
Aha! The little brat holed up in there

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:26.840
with that bumbling quack Professor Von Schlemmer.

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:28.880
You two, make a distraction.

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:29.900
Hi-yah!

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:31.170
your sneakiness?

00:10:31.840 --> 00:10:47.640
Looks like those two badniks just don't know

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:49.550
when to quit. I'd better

00:10:49.550 --> 00:10:51.320
remind them. Here you are.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:53.080
A direct route down.

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:56.040
Great. Way faster than an elevator.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:03.870
You betcha. Gotta speed, Keed.

00:11:05.940 --> 00:11:11.420
Gets rid of that pesky hedgehog.

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:14.040
Now then, a bit of disguise.

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:23.620
Knew this camera scope would come in handy one day.

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:29.980
Aha! Now with my...

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.150
Rocket Pat, zoom over there and grab the ladder.

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:29.810
Move your gearbox is in my shaft. It's only a mirror

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:34.890
I look awful. That's better.

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:37.920
Ah! Enough, games!

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:42.480
Oh, I'm going to lock you in a closet and take your place.

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:44.940
Ha! I don't have a closet.

00:12:45.470 --> 00:12:48.730
Then I guess I'll have to push you out the ladder hole.

00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:51.880
Oh, wait. You mean this closet.

00:13:03.480 --> 00:13:05.860
I found the dinglehoppers you wanted.

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:08.960
Hey! You've gained weight.

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:13.520
It's simply your imagination, my dear pie.

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:16.420
Now let's see what we have here.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:20.250
Aha! No good at all.

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:26.870
We need more weapons, more aggressiveness, lasers, stun gas, nets, and above all, more speed.

00:13:30.020 --> 00:13:32.490
Professor, do you feel okay?

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:35.390
You look all bloated and ugly.

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:37.370
No time for Cheddar Boy.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:42.230
Fetch me two dozen vatsets and the Matrix wrench now.

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:48.840
This machine will be the perfect tool to nail Sonic with.

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:52.980
And best of all, his own little friend will help me do it.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.140
Hey, where's the lamp?

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:07.060
No, how about a drop?

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:15.720
Professor would never waste a piece of expensive machinery.

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:19.340
Something's up and I'm gonna get to the bottom of it.

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:23.920
Or maybe I should get to the top of it.

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:26.340
Tails' new invention is real you.

00:14:34.090 --> 00:14:49.620
activated the professor security system I'm going in autopilot engage fire away

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:04.240
Oh, being a hedgehog has its points.

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:10.400
And thou will add Attractor Ray to slow down his blasted little fast feet.

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:16.340
Are you kidding? Robotnik's not fast. He's a slow, stinky old watermelon.

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:21.700
Let me just test this here.

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:28.160
Good.

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:36.950
You only live once, and I live fast.

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:41.800
I thought this would be an open-and-shut job.

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:47.960
Sonic?

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:57.390
Sonic, what are you hanging around there for?

00:15:57.970 --> 00:15:58.750
Never mind.

00:15:59.160 --> 00:15:59.980
Just give me a rope.

00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:08.500
Hey! You're the professor!

00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:14.120
Brilliant deduction, you shrimpy Sherlock!

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:24.500
Buddy's in trouble! Time to get this pipe a-smoking!

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:39.340
Don't even ask, egg-headed egomaniac.

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:40.210
Sonic?

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:41.110
Ow!

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:42.930
Stop!

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:48.530
Ha! You're too late, Sonic!

00:16:49.010 --> 00:16:53.210
My, or should I say, Tails machine is ready to roll!

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:59.850
I didn't mean to help him, Sonic! I didn't know!

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:02.520
Never mind that. We gotta scoot.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:11.530
Wait for me! I want to watch!

00:17:14.730 --> 00:17:16.610
Do you remember how that thing turns off?

00:17:17.060 --> 00:17:19.720
I spilled juice on that part of my diagram!

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:24.060
It's a dead egg!

00:17:24.950 --> 00:17:27.790
Hey, Sonic the Hedgehog never says dead!

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:28.780
Jump!

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:36.320
That gets rid of that thing.

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:37.700
Not quite.

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:40.730
I added a few optional features to it,

00:17:40.930 --> 00:17:43.310
like a backup propeller and wings.

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:07.450
No renegade robot runs off with my pal.

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:11.340
Time to take off, Professor!

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:14.560
Robotnik!

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:16.320
Professor!

00:18:18.940 --> 00:18:19.480
Idiot!

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:37.310
Hey! How'd he do that?

00:18:39.980 --> 00:18:40.440
Ow!

00:18:59.270 --> 00:18:59.810
You're a bot!

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:12.910
Thanks for breaking our foyer fileness!

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:15.220
That's not all I'll break!

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:16.540
Get off me!

00:19:19.160 --> 00:19:21.250
Ew! Make this thing go faster!

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:22.870
I need more power!

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:25.450
I'm giving her all she's got, Captain!

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:27.780
Don't tell him about the red button!

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:29.460
It'll give him super speed!

00:19:32.590 --> 00:19:33.570
Jump, Professor!

00:19:51.220 --> 00:19:53.650
Thank you, thank you.

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:56.550
We hope you have all enjoyed your flight on Sonic Airways.

00:19:56.810 --> 00:19:58.550
Our business may be up and down,

00:19:58.770 --> 00:19:59.970
but we're no fly-by-dons!

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:09.070
But Sonic, I'm sorry the Robotnik Dabber didn't work.

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:11.510
Hey, no worries, kiddo.

00:20:11.530 --> 00:20:13.240
I had a great birthday.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:14.940
A little light on the...

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:17.200
chili dogs, though. So, Tails,

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:19.440
will you be staying around to help me

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:21.080
with my inventions? No.

00:20:21.260 --> 00:20:23.380
Being an inventor was fun, but

00:20:23.380 --> 00:20:25.500
I have to help Sonic in his adventures.

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:27.000
Sure thing.

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:29.810
We gotta be ready for Robotic when he gets back.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:35.130
from wherever he ended up he's probably at the north pool right now cool

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:01.100
There's nothing to do.

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:03.590
You gotta create your own fun, little bud.

00:21:04.020 --> 00:21:04.960
Use your imagination!

00:21:05.690 --> 00:21:06.430
Build something.

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:08.040
Gotta speed, G.

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:08.970
Oh, my God.

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:13.460
Great swing, Tails.

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:15.940
That's astronaut tails to you, Sonic.

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:18.990
When you use your imagination...

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:22.400
There's no limit to the places you can go and things you can do.

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:31.190
Thank you.

00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:32.480
Thank you.
